invalid type: string "User: mujhe png and webp mai ferk batoo\nAssistant: Mayank ji, PNG aur WebP dono hi image file formats hain, lekin ve alag-alag tarah se kaam karte hain.\n\nPNG (Portable Network Graphics):\n- PNG ek lossless image file format hai, jiska matlab hai ki yeh image ko compress karne ke baad bhi uski ghaat aur detail bachi rehti hai.\nाना चाहत\u{947} ह\u{948}�9��